TABLE 3: Pair transfer matrix eigenvalues
M = [[1,1,1],[1,1,0],[1,1,1]], char poly = lambda*(lambda^2 - 3*lambda + 1)
Eigenvalues: 0, phi^2 = (3+sqrt5)/2 = 2.618034, 1/phi^2 = 0.381966

Pair sequence (powers of M applied to [1,1,1]):
a_n:        [1, 3, 8, 21, 55, 144, 377, 987, 2584, 6765]
F_{2n+2}:   [1, 3, 8, 21, 55, 144, 377, 987, 2584, 6765]
Match:      True

